@host = http://localhost:5080

### Create (send twice: same Idempotency-Key returns the same order)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 7d1c2c2e-key-001

{ "customerId": "CUST-100", "amount": 250.75 }

### Validation error -> 400 ValidationProblem
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: bad-1

{ "customerId": "X", "amount": 0 }

### List (paged + output cached)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders?page=1&pageSize=10

### Get by id
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders/1

### Global error handling -> 500 ProblemDetails
GET {{host}}/api/v1/boom

### Health
GET {{host}}/health/ready
